msgid ""
"inlet (:math:`x = 0`): parabolic profile, :math:`u_x(y) = 4\\,y\\,(1 - "
"y)`,"
msgstr "入口（\\ :math:`x = 0`\\ ）：抛物型分布，\\ :math:`u_x(y) = 4\\,y\\,(1 - y)`\\ ，"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/flow_obstacles.rst:50
#: ad1191957eb04bb9aaf155ec1c013267
msgid "walls (:math:`y = 0`, :math:`y = 1`) and obstacle surfaces: no-slip,"
msgstr "壁面（\\ :math:`y = 0`\\ 、\\ :math:`y = 1`\\ ）与障碍物表面：无滑移，"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/flow_obstacles.rst:52
#: 0557fe3a901a4061a8a16e824ac1eeac
msgid ""
"outlet (:math:`x = 3`): \"do-nothing\" (natural), which also fixes the "
"pressure gauge — no pressure BC at all."
msgstr "出口（\\ :math:`x = 3`\\ ）：\"do-nothing\"（自然边界条件），同时固定压力基准——完全不需要施加压力边界条件。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/flow_obstacles.rst:55
#: e9f331dc69af437c8a4dc81e00081905
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"At :math:`\\mathrm{Re} = 150` the flow is steady (no shedding), the wake "
"of each obstacle interacts with the next, and the solution shows "
"characteristic narrow jets between the closely- spaced cylinders."
msgstr ""
"在 :math:`\\mathrm{Re} = 150` "
"时流动是稳态的（无脱落），每个障碍物的尾迹与下一个相互作用，解中呈现出靠得很近的圆柱之间特征性的狭窄射流。"

