"The most interesting part of this script is the mesh-generation block — "
"it is short, self-contained, and demonstrates the ``add_…`` / "
"``remove_…`` style of CSG that :class:`~tensormesh.MeshGen` exposes:"
msgstr ""
"这个脚本最有意思的部分是网格生成代码块——它简短、自成体系，并展示了 :class:`~tensormesh.MeshGen` 所暴露的 "
"``add_…`` / ``remove_…`` 风格的 CSG："

