#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/flow_obstacles.rst:93
#: 8877a5c979c84bd58d2bcf224f741938
msgid ""
"Identical to :doc:`cavity` — the same two-field ``NavierStokesAssembler``"
" (Picard-linearized convection, four-line scalar integrand) with richer "
"boundary masks. Because the velocity DOFs include topologically generated"
" edge nodes, the masks are built from the layout's own coordinates and "
"boundary detection — no geometric distance tests against the obstacle "
"circles needed:"
msgstr ""
"与 :doc:`cavity` 相同——使用相同的双场 ``NavierStokesAssembler``\\ （Picard "
"线性化对流，四行标量被积函数），但具有更丰富的边界掩码。由于速度自由度包含按拓扑生成的边节点，掩码直接从布局自身的坐标和边界检测构建——无需对障碍圆进行几何距离测试："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/flow_obstacles.rst:116
#: f3377767628a41d7b8571c49945bb281
msgid ""
"The obstacle surfaces fall out of the topological classification "
"automatically: they are boundary nodes that are neither inlet nor outlet."
msgstr "障碍物表面自动由拓扑分类得出：它们是既非入口也非出口的边界节点。"

