msgid ""
"Speed magnitude and pressure for steady flow past 6 random circular "
"obstacles"
msgstr "绕 6 个随机圆形障碍物稳态流动的速度大小与压力"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/flow_obstacles.rst:138
#: 68e11b8283b04a16b0ff78ff1f18d49d
msgid ""
"Output of ``flow_obstacles.py`` at Re = 150 (Taylor-Hood P2-P1). Left: "
"speed magnitude — high-velocity jets squeeze between obstacle pairs and "
"broaden into wakes downstream. Right: pressure — stagnation upstream of "
"each obstacle, low-pressure pockets in the wakes, and a near-uniform "
"streamwise pressure drop across the channel."
msgstr ""
"``flow_obstacles.py`` 在 Re = 150 时的输出（Taylor-Hood "
"P2-P1）。左：速度大小——高速射流在障碍对之间挤压，并在下游扩展为尾流。右：压力——每个障碍物上游形成滞止，尾流中出现低压区，通道内沿流向压力近乎均匀下降。"

